  "details": "I feel like an option to invert movement for hand tracking, as pushing away from you to move forward doesn't feel natural to some, same goes for turning. Another thing, physically turning whilst using hand tracked movement causes you to move backwards.\n\nAnother open menu gesture option would be great, pinching both hands together then pulling to both scale, rotate, and summon the menu would be AMAZING. There are a few worlds that do this already! Closing would be the same, but opposite.\n\nThe menus should have an option to be touch-interact, as opposed to strictly pinch. Thanks!",
